<title>USA: AirWays Corp Sept load rises to 61.9 pct.</title>
<headline>AirWays Corp Sept load rises to 61.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>AIRTRAN AIRWAYS TRAFFIC RESULTS:</p>
<p>				Sep '96     Sep '95	  % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Carried:	  75,082   37,416	   +  101 %</p>
<p>ASMs  (000):		  103,342   69,942	   +   48 %</p>
<p>RPMs  (000):		   64,001   31,984	   +  100 %</p>
<p>Load Factor:		    61.9%    45.7%	   +  16.2 pts</p>
<p>					   Year-to-Date</p>
<p>				    9 months ended Sep. 30, 1996</p>
<p>			     YTD 96	 YTD 95	 % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Carried:   837,640    282,036	   +  197 %</p>
<p>ASMs  (000):	  1,109,003    440,833	   +  152 %</p>
<p>RPMs  (000):	    731,574    256,649	   +  185 %</p>
<p>Load Factor:		66.0%	58.2%	   +  7.8  pts</p>
</text>
